{"id":"6f4ddd360c890dee","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-propositional-proof-system.md","title":"命题证明系统与多项式有界性","display":"df-propositional-proof-system — 命题证明系统与多项式有界性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-propositional-proof-system","aliases":["28-df-propositional-proof-system"],"display":"df-propositional-proof-system — 命题证明系统与多项式有界性","depends_on":["[[28-df-boolean-formula]]","[[28-df-boolean-evaluation]]","[[28-df-sat]]","[[28-df-polynomial-time-function]]"],"source_status":"supplementary-formalization","source_printed_pages":"307–309","source_pdf_pages":"333–335"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-propositional-proof-system"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-propositional-proof-system</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-propositional-proof-system — 命题证明系统与多项式有界性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"supplementary-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"307–309"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"333–335"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(\\pi\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFml},\\mathrm{PropVar},\\mathrm{Eval}_\\alpha\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b830febc662345bf\" href=\"?note=b830febc662345bf\" title=\"28-df-boolean-formula\">28-df-boolean-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2eb3efc252f058f9\" href=\"?note=2eb3efc252f058f9\" title=\"28-df-boolean-evaluation\">28-df-boolean-evaluation</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}\">\\(\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4041cfa2975b8dd1\" href=\"?note=4041cfa2975b8dd1\" title=\"28-df-sat\">28-df-sat</a> 固定的有效公式编码。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{FP}\">\\(\\mathbf{FP}\\)</span> 为多项式时间字串函数类，see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"adb92775ec020a0b\" href=\"?note=adb92775ec020a0b\" title=\"28-df-polynomial-time-function\">28-df-polynomial-time-function</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(P:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span>；证明是二进制字串；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TAUT}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\land\\forall\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\varphi)=1\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TAUT}\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi)\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{BoolFml}\\land\\forall\\alpha:\\mathrm{PropVar}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\;\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\alpha}(\\varphi)=1\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProofSys}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow P\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ProofSys}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow P\\in\\mathbf{FP}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(P)=\\mathrm{TAUT}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_P(\\pi,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow P(\\pi)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProofSys}(P)\\land\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(|\\pi|\\le c(|y|+1)^d\\land P(\\pi)=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_P(\\pi,\\varphi)\\Longleftrightarrow P(\\pi)=\\operatorname{enc}_{\\mathrm B}(\\varphi),\\qquad\\operatorname{PolyBounded}(P)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{ProofSys}(P)\\land\\exists c,d\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall y\\in\\mathrm{TAUT}\\;\\exists\\pi\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(|\\pi|\\le c(|y|+1)^d\\land P(\\pi)=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是 Cook–Reckhow 型总映射包装：值域包含于 TAUT 表示可靠，值域覆盖 TAUT 表示完备。无效证明字串可统一输出某个固定永真式。原书本章讨论可有效检查的具体证明系统，本项是为其提供的本地通用接口，不声称书中给出此命名定义。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§15.1–15.2，印刷 pp.307–309 / PDF pp.333–335；Cook–Reckhow 包装为本地补充。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","leve